## the legacy engine (MPL-2.0)

The hyphenation engine in this package is a Dart implementation of the
algorithm of [the legacy engine](https://github.com/the legacy engine)
(`hyphen.c`, `hyphen.h`), whose authors offer it under a
GPL 2.0 / LGPL 2.1 / MPL 1.1-or-later tri-license.

**The MPL branch of that grant is elected here, at version 2.0.** MPL 2.0
applies per file: the files that carry the algorithm are Covered Software and
each says so in its own header:

- `lib/src/model/pattern_automaton.dart`
- `lib/src/model/pattern_set.dart`
- `lib/src/model/edge_limits.dart`
- `lib/src/builder/pattern_trie.dart`
- `lib/src/builder/pattern_level_builder.dart`
- `lib/src/parser/dictionary_parser.dart`
- `lib/src/parser/dictionary_line_scanner.dart`
- `lib/src/constant/dictionary_syntax.dart`
- `lib/src/processor/break_marker.dart`
- `lib/src/processor/break_mark_processor.dart`
- `lib/src/buffer/replacement_pool.dart`
- `lib/src/buffer/rewrite_track.dart`
- `lib/src/buffer/match_scratch.dart`
- `lib/src/util/byte_reader.dart`

Everything else — the widgets, the line breaker, the caches, the tests and
the benchmarks — is covered by the MIT license above, as a Larger Work under
MPL 2.0 §3.3. No copy of Hyphen's C sources is redistributed here.

The hyphenation dictionary (`hyph_*.dic`) is **not** bundled with this
package; you supply your own, and it carries its own license. See
[THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md](./THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md) for the full MPL 2.0
text and the details.
